        {
          "es": "De la carne de Ymir hicieron la tierra.",
          "en": "From Ymir's flesh they made the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "De su sangre, el mar y todos los lagos.",
          "en": "From his blood, the sea and all the lakes."
        },
        {
          "es": "De su pelo, los árboles y los bosques.",
          "en": "From his hair, the trees and the forests."
        },
        {
          "es": "De sus huesos levantaron las montañas.",
          "en": "From his bones they raised the mountains."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y de sus dientes y sus huesos rotos hicieron las piedras y las rocas.",
          "en": "And from his teeth and his broken bones they made the stones and the rocks."
        }
