    {
      "id": "cielo",
      "fondo": "cielo",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 0,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.1
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Del cráneo de Ymir hicieron el cielo, y lo alzaron como una cúpula enorme sobre la tierra.",
          "en": "From Ymir's skull they made the sky, and raised it like an enormous dome over the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus sesos los soltaron en el aire, y se volvieron las nubes.",
          "en": "His brains they scattered into the air, and they became the clouds."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el cielo era pesado, y alguien tenía que sostenerlo.",
          "en": "But the sky was heavy, and someone had to hold it up."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que los dioses pusieron un enano en cada esquina del mundo.",
          "en": "So the gods set a dwarf at each corner of the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se llaman Nordri, Sudri, Austri y Vestri: Norte, Sur, Este y Oeste.",
          "en": "Their names are Nordri, Sudri, Austri and Vestri: North, South, East and West."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso existen el norte, el sur, el este y el oeste.",
          "en": "That is why we have north, south, east and west."
        }
      ],
