      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Aun así, el cielo estaba oscuro. Pero las chispas de Muspelheim seguían volando por el abismo.",
          "en": "Even so, the sky was dark. But the sparks of Muspelheim were still flying through the gap."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los hermanos tomaron las chispas y las brasas que brillaban, una por una.",
          "en": "The brothers took the glowing sparks and embers, one by one."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y las pusieron en el cielo, arriba y abajo, para dar luz al cielo y a la tierra.",
          "en": "And they set them in the sky, above and below, to give light to the heavens and the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así nacieron las estrellas. A cada una le dieron su lugar y su camino.",
          "en": "That is how the stars were born. Each one was given its place and its path."
        }
      ],
