      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "A los gigantes les dieron las tierras de la costa lejana, a orillas del mar profundo.",
          "en": "The giants were given the far shores of the land, beside the deep sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero los gigantes eran enemigos de los dioses, y el centro del mundo debía quedar a salvo.",
          "en": "But the giants were enemies of the gods, and the middle of the world had to be kept safe."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los dioses levantaron un muro alrededor, hecho con las cejas de Ymir.",
          "en": "So the gods raised a wall all around it, made from Ymir's eyebrows."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese lugar protegido se llamó Midgard, y fue hecho para los hombres.",
          "en": "That sheltered place was called Midgard, and it was made for people."
        }
      ],
