      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, en la carne de Ymir, que ahora era la tierra, algo se movía.",
          "en": "Meanwhile, in Ymir's flesh, which was now the earth, something was stirring."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eran gusanos, como los que nacen en un cuerpo sin vida.",
          "en": "They were maggots, like those that breed in a lifeless body."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses los miraron, y les dieron forma de hombres y una mente inteligente.",
          "en": "The gods looked at them, and gave them the shape of men and a clever mind."
        },
        {
          "es": "Son los enanos. Viven bajo la tierra y entre las rocas, lejos del sol.",
          "en": "These are the dwarves. They live under the earth and among the rocks, far from the sun."
        }
      ],
